<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CEZ 96 gross profit 13.7 bln.</title>
<headline>Czech CEZ 96 gross profit 13.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech power utility CEZ a.s. said on Monday that according to preliminary, unaudited results it posted a gross profit of 13.7 billion crowns.</p>
<p>Company spokesman Ladislav Kriz added that the firm expects to pay a 3.25 percent gross dividend on 1996 profits.</p>
<p>He added that the company expects 1997 net profits of 6.1 billion crowns on revenues of 64.2 billion crowns.</p>
<p>He gave no further figures.  </p>
<p>All of the figures are calculated according to Czech accounting standards.</p>
<p>Czech shares closed up five crowns at 1,205 on the Prague Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2423-0003</p>
